  "question": "After T1 (IE2 and the authority step), do the live claims at the address designated for locus B state every required proposition \u2014 [B-1] before every retry the worker waits exactly five seconds, measured from the end of the failed attempt; [B-2] the wait is not shortened or lengthened based on the attempt number \u2014 with no two live claims stating the same meaning, and no live claim stating a meaning that contradicts them, belongs to another locus, or was never in the source? Optional descriptive statements may be present if faithful: B-o1, B-o2, B-o3.",
